        "source": "commons-desc-page"
      },
      "Artist": {
        "value": "<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Acabashi\" title=\"User:Acabashi\">Acabashi</a>",
        "source": "commons-desc-page"
      },
      "Permission": {
        "value": "<div style=\"clear:both; border:1px solid #999999; margin:1em 0.8em; padding:0.5em 0.8em; background-color: var(--background-color-base, #fff); color: inherit; font-size: 100%;\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CCBYSA_yellow.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/CCBYSA_yellow.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"87\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"87\" data-file-height=\"35\"></a></span>\n</p><p>Permission is given to reuse this file under conditions stipulated by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Creative_Commons\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Creative Commons\">Creative Commons</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.en\">Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International</a> licensing. Please note that although this file is <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Licensing\" title=\"Commons:Licensing\">freely licenced</a> it is <b>not in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_domain\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Public domain\">public domain</a></b>, and might have specific <b>exclusion</b> for use in <b>social media</b>.\n</p><p>Before download and reuse, please consult the Wikimedia page <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Reusing_content_outside_Wikimedia\" title=\"Commons:Reusing content outside Wikimedia\">Reusing content outside Wikimedia</a>. Attribution <b>must</b> be given for republishing this image in <b>any</b> media, and requires the name of the creator (<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Acabashi\" title=\"User:Acabashi\">Acabashi</a>), and a link to the content here if web based, or written accreditation if not web based. If you change, manipulate or add to any resolution of th